# Visme
> Visme is an AI-powered visual content platform for creating presentations, infographics, documents, reports, social graphics, videos, and interactive content.

Visme helps marketers, educators, sales teams, and business users turn ideas, information, and data into visual content using templates, AI tools, brand controls, and data visualization features.

Key capabilities:
- Create presentations, infographics, reports, proposals, documents, social graphics, and videos
- Use AI tools to generate designs, presentations, images, and content ideas
- Build interactive and animated content for web sharing and presentations
- Collaborate with teams and maintain brand consistency across projects

